  "description": "HttpClient-based async .NET client for the MyWebAPI.com trading platform management API (v2). Envelope-aware, supports idempotency keys, per-request timeouts, field selection, and paged iteration via IAsyncEnumerable.",
  "id": "MyWebApi.Sdk",
